===Noun===
{{head|en|noun plural form}}

# {{plural of|curtain|lang=en}}
# {{lb|en|figuratively|in reference to curtains closing at the end of a stage show}} An [[end]], [[death]]
#: ''It's '''curtains''' for you!''
#: "''What if a bunch of [[scuba diver]]s nosed about here?''" / "'''''Curtains''' for them, when our [[wikipedia:side-scan sonar|side-scan sonar]] sees them.''"
#{{lb|en|colloquial}} a [[ring]] of clear [[liquid]], forming into [[drop]]s, near the top of a [[glass]] of [[fortified]] [[wine]]; the result of [[differential]] [[evaporation]] of [[alcohol]] and subsequent changes in [[surface tension]]; an example of the {{l|en|Marangoni effect}}

====Synonyms====
*{{lb|en|alcohol effect}}: {{l|en|church windows}}, {{l|en|legs}}, {{l|en|tears of wine}}, {{l|en|wine tears}}

